  "text": "QA Owner full 1792004374886\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nQA Owner full 1792004374886 — Main Branch\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nBranch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nQA Owner full 1792004374886 — Main Branch · MAIN\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nRestaurant workspace\n← Back to managementShow advanced tools\nLAUNCH SETUP\nGuided Menu Setup\nPayment Acceptance\nTables & QR\nPayment Settings\nOrdering Rules\nINSIGHTS\nCollection Reconciliation\nAnalytics\nLIVE OPERATIONS\nPickup Calendar\nOverview\nQR Orders\nService Requests\nBRANDING\nQR Print Packs\nCustomer Branding\nMENU & GUESTS\nCustomers & Loyalty\nMenu & Availability\nADVANCED CONFIGURATION\nAdvanced Features\nQR Ordering license active\nQA Owner full plan 1792004374886 · 16/10/2026\nLicenses and device access are managed by your platform administrator.\nProduct website\nQR ORDERING / LAUNCH SETUP\nPayment Settings\n\nControl online checkout and counter payments with clear collection status.\n\n✦ JAMAN AI\nEnabled\nBranch\nCurrent admin scope\nQA Owner full 1792004374886 — Main Branch\n\nRestaurant defaults apply until a branch overrides a setting. Other branches keep their own configuration.\n\nSecure payment collection\n\nAsk Super Admin to activate payment collection for this restaurant. Razorpay Route is not required for Jamanvaar collection with manual payouts.\n\nRazorpay\nNot configured\nUnavailable to guests\n\nUPI and other methods are offered by the secure provider according to merchant activation. Configure credentials and collection approval through Super Admin. Secrets are never shown here.\n\nOnline payment\nCash at Counter\nPayment instructionsSave payment instructions\nFrom (restaurant date)\nTo (restaurant date)\nBranch\nCurrent admin scope\nQA Owner full 1792004374886 — Main Branch\n\nTimezone: Asia/Kolkata. Calendar days run midnight to midnight and include both selected dates. UTC export boundaries: 2026-10-08T18:30:00.000Z to 2026-10-15T18:30:00.000Z (exclusive).\n\n0\nOnline successes\n0\nFailed attempts\n0\nPending attempts\n₹0.00\nCollected payments\n₹0.00\nOutstanding at counter\n\nLanding sessions and menu views are deduplicated per code, signed browser session and restaurant day. Accepted orders exclude online drafts and cancellations. Gross paid sales include collected counter payments and verified online payments. Net sales subtract successful partial or full refunds for these orders. Conversion is an order-to-session ratio and may exceed 100% when a guest orders again.\n\nRecent online payment attempts\n\nNo online attempts in this period.",
